## SECTION 3: WHAT ESSENTIALS INCLUDES
*(Clear expansion of the table)*

**Section headline:** What you get with Essentials

- **Loki AI support, 24/7** — describe your problem any time, get an immediate response. No phone queue.
- **Unlimited remote expert sessions** — when Loki can't fix it, a real technician joins your screen and resolves the issue. Included in your monthly plan — no extra charge per session.
- **Coverage for all your devices** — Windows, macOS, iPhone, iPad, Android (remote support where applicable)
- **No long-term contract** — subscribe monthly, cancel anytime. No minimum commitment.
- **Pricing in USD.** *(EU pricing: see note below)*

